/p>","sentences":[{"en":"The materials for all classes are freely available under open source licenses such as Creative Commons.","zh":null},{"en":"That means other instructors can use and remix materials in their own classes.","zh":null},{"en":"Or that a new instructor can pick up where a previous one left off.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h3 id=\"h.vp4cx8yrbcpi_l\" dir=\"ltr\"><span>Open Access</span></h3>","sentences":[{"en":"Open Access","zh":"开放获取"}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Anyone can freely take our self-paced classes at any time. No waiting for class enrollments to open up. Just learn at your own pace as soon as you're ready.</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Anyone can freely take our self-paced classes at any time.","zh":null},{"en":"No waiting for class enrollments to open up.","zh":null},{"en":"Just learn at your own pace as soon as you're ready.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Our classes are designed to take students down a well-formed learning path towards the skills they need to work in high-skill, high-pay cybersecurity jobs.</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Our classes are designed to take students down a well-formed learning path towards the skills they need to work in high-skill, high-pay cybersecurity jobs.","zh":null}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div jsaction=\"gsiSmd:Ffcznf;yj5fUd:cpPetb;HNXL3:q0Vyke;e2SXKd:IPDu5e;BdXpgd:nhk7K;rcuQ6b:WYd;\" jscontroller=\"Md9ENb\" data-legacy-theme-color-kit=\"SunsetOrange\" data-legacy-theme-font-kit=\"Capital\" data-legacy-theme-name=\"Impression\" data-uses-custom-theme=\"false\" jsname=\"UzWXSb\" tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"ltr\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"h.INITIAL_GRID.95uuumsnwnr9\" jscontroller=\"sGwD4d\" jsaction=\"zXBUYb:zTPCnb;zQF9Uc:Qxe3nd;\" jsname=\"F57UId\"><p><img src=\"Home/837c740996ab6a7d0c57b57752870ff0.jpg\" role=\"img\"></p></div><div tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"h.33efd66436177895_8\" jscontroller=\"sGwD4d\" jsaction=\"zXBUYb:zTPCnb;zQF9Uc:Qxe3nd;\" jsname=\"F57UId\" role=\"main\"><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"h.7h41b1so0ful_l\">欢迎</h2></div><div tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"h.4f6963449a13c2a8_4\" jscontroller=\"sGwD4d\" jsaction=\"zXBUYb:zTPCnb;zQF9Uc:Qxe3nd;\" jsname=\"F57UId\"><p dir=\"ltr\">OpenSecurityTraining2's mission is to provide the world's deepest and best cybersecurity training.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">That our classes are free is just a bonus!</p></div><div id=\"h.4f6963449a13c2a8_25\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div jscontroller=\"sGwD4d\" jsaction=\"zXBUYb:zTPCnb;zQF9Uc:Qxe3nd;\" jsname=\"F57UId\"><div id=\"h.4f6963449a13c2a8_53\"><p><img src=\"Home/cdb424d24622296e366c96d7164af4f9.jpg\" role=\"img\"></p></div><div id=\"h.4f6963449a13c2a8_30\"><h3 id=\"h.ra0mn1x0synb_l\" dir=\"ltr\">开源</h3></div><div id=\"h.4f6963449a13c2a8_32\"><p dir=\"ltr\">The materials for all classes are freely available under open source licenses such as Creative Commons. That means other instructors can use and remix materials in their own classes. Or that a new instructor can pick up where a previous one left off.</p></div></div><div jscontroller=\"sGwD4d\" jsaction=\"zXBUYb:zTPCnb;zQF9Uc:Qxe3nd;\" jsname=\"F57UId\"><div id=\"h.51cb2074f87e3c7f_3\"><p><img src=\"Home/fa72b7bb0bcd9a908f037d251a93ec1a.jpg\" role=\"img\"></p></div><div id=\"h.4f6963449a13c2a8_37\"><h3 id=\"h.vp4cx8yrbcpi_l\" dir=\"ltr\">开放获取</h3></div><div id=\"h.4f6963449a13c2a8_39\"><p dir=\"ltr\">Anyone can freely take our self-paced classes at any time. No waiting for class enrollments to open up. Just learn at your own pace as soon as you're ready.</p></div></div><div jscontroller=\"sGwD4d\" jsaction=\"zXBUYb:zTPCnb;zQF9Uc:Qxe3nd;\" jsname=\"F57UId\"><div id=\"h.1d6fd734f98dbec9_22\"><a href=\"Learning-Paths.html\"><p><img src=\"Home/0a6c5f405407f181aab64c1309d4cd34.jpg\"></p></a></div><div id=\"h.4f6963449a13c2a8_46\"><p dir=\"ltr\">Our classes are designed to take students down a well-formed learning path towards the skills they need to work in high-skill, high-pay cybersecurity jobs.</p></div></div></div><div tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"h.24edfe71711f3b48_12\" jscontroller=\"sGwD4d\" jsaction=\"zXBUYb:zTPCnb;zQF9Uc:Qxe3nd;\" jsname=\"F57UId\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fost2.fyi%2FPartner_TCG&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw09rFxbI2jcm_-NzCEUIth1\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img src=\"Home/015cf537ae2240147468c3216df2654d.jpg\"></p></a></div><div id=\"h.24edfe71711f3b48_20\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div jscontroller=\"sGwD4d\" jsaction=\"zXBUYb:zTPCnb;zQF9Uc:Qxe3nd;\" jsname=\"F57UId\" id=\"h.24edfe71711f3b48_23\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fost2.fyi%2FSponsor_3mdeb&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw2JZWElq-15nOz_Wkv92ply\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img src=\"Home/7c840b80052fa2c90788b32ba4c2de93.jpg\"></p></a></div><div jscontroller=\"sGwD4d\" jsaction=\"zXBUYb:zTPCnb;zQF9Uc:Qxe3nd;\" jsname=\"F57UId\" id=\"h.15116380b68c553_0\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fost2.fyi%2FSponsor_AMI&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw0c0JWe82aVHAaZZr4t3nvv\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img src=\"Home/7c3917b65fe8b91036766669672151a1.jpg\"></p></a></div></div><div id=\"h.38e69d0057bf92c5_0\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div jscontroller=\"sGwD4d\" jsaction=\"zXBUYb:zTPCnb;zQF9Uc:Qxe3nd;\" jsname=\"F57UId\" id=\"h.7149f4420171d20b_16\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fost2.fyi%2FSponsor_Binarly_web&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw1yELaZSYYo7V2s-rDat0im\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img src=\"Home/d9609689360568f0a2e25a47ad2008e9.jpg\"></p></a></div><div jscontroller=\"sGwD4d\" jsaction=\"zXBUYb:zTPCnb;zQF9Uc:Qxe3nd;\" jsname=\"F57UId\" id=\"h.bdd58c2ae6a1bf5_3\"><a href=\"http://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fost2.fyi%2FSponsor_DarkMentor&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw2ERKFvz_OsBFx0UPSP02vz\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img src=\"Home/c06a7ba403f2eb6cd608aca50450aecf.jpg\"></p></a></div></div><div id=\"h.bee7a3041babf37_0\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div jscontroller=\"sGwD4d\" jsaction=\"zXBUYb:zTPCnb;zQF9Uc:Qxe3nd;\" jsname=\"F57UId\" id=\"h.38e69d0057bf92c